### ============================================================
### NexConvo Chat API — Manual Test Requests
### ============================================================
### How to use (VS Code REST Client / JetBrains .http):
###   1. Run STEP 1–3 in order (signup → verify-email → login)
###   2. Copy the accessToken from the login response
###   3. Paste it into the @token variable below
###   4. Run the Chat API requests
###
### Services needed:
###   Identity  → http://localhost:5047
###   Chat      → http://localhost:5132
### ============================================================

@identityBase = http://localhost:5047
@chatBase      = http://localhost:5132

### ── Paste your access token here after login ─────────────────
@token = PASTE_ACCESS_TOKEN_HERE


### ============================================================
### STEP 1 — Sign up (run once; skip if account already exists)
### ============================================================

POST {{identityBase}}/api/v1/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tenantName":  "Acme Corp",
  "tenantSlug":  "acme",
  "email":       "admin@acme.com",
  "password":    "Test@1234!",
  "fullName":    "Acme Admin"
}

###

### ============================================================
### STEP 2 — Verify email (copy token from Mailpit: http://localhost:8025)
### ============================================================

POST {{identityBase}}/api/v1/auth/verify-email
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "token": "PASTE_EMAIL_VERIFICATION_TOKEN_HERE"
}

###

### ============================================================
### STEP 3 — Login → copy accessToken into @token above
### ============================================================

POST {{identityBase}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tenantSlug": "acme",
  "email":      "admin@acme.com",
  "password":   "Test@1234!"
}

###


### ============================================================
### CHANNEL CONNECTIONS
### ============================================================

### List all connections (empty on a fresh DB)
GET {{chatBase}}/api/v1/channel-connections
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

###

### Connect a Web Widget (channel = 0, no external account needed)
POST {{chatBase}}/api/v1/channel-connections
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "channel":           0,
  "externalAccountId": null,
  "accountName":       "Website Widget",
  "accessToken":       "web-widget"
}

###

### Connect a Telegram bot (channel = 4)
POST {{chatBase}}/api/v1/channel-connections
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "channel":           4,
  "externalAccountId": "@mycompanybot",
  "accountName":       "Company Telegram Bot",
  "accessToken":       "123456789:ABCdefGHIjklMNOpqrSTUvwxYZ"
}

###

### Test a connection (validates token with the platform)
POST {{chatBase}}/api/v1/channel-connections/test
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "channel":     4,
  "accessToken": "123456789:ABCdefGHIjklMNOpqrSTUvwxYZ"
}

###

### Delete a connection (replace GUID with real ID from the list response)
DELETE {{chatBase}}/api/v1/channel-connections/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###


### ============================================================
### CHAT SETTINGS
### ============================================================

### Get current settings (returns defaults if never saved)
GET {{chatBase}}/api/v1/chat-settings
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

###

### Save chat settings
PUT {{chatBase}}/api/v1/chat-settings
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "botName":                    "NexConvo Assistant",
  "welcomeMessage":             "Hi! How can I help you today?",
  "handoffConfidenceThreshold": 0.65,
  "escalationTriggerPhrases":   ["speak to a manager", "human agent", "real person"],
  "isEnabled":                  true
}

###


### ============================================================
### KNOWLEDGE BASE
### ============================================================

### List knowledge documents (paginated)
GET {{chatBase}}/api/v1/knowledge-documents?page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

###

### Get a single document (replace GUID with real ID)
GET {{chatBase}}/api/v1/knowledge-documents/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

###

### Upload a document — use curl (multipart not supported in .http):
### curl -X POST http://localhost:5132/api/v1/knowledge-documents \
###   -H "Authorization: Bearer <token>" \
###   -F "file=@C:/path/to/document.pdf" \
###   -F "title=Product FAQ" \
###   -F "sourceType=file"


### ============================================================
### HEALTH CHECKS
### ============================================================

GET {{chatBase}}/health/live
###
GET {{chatBase}}/health/ready
###
